hello 1.0

This file is installed by e1pkg as /share/doc/hello/README.

The package payload is a ustar archive whose first member is a
plain-text manifest (name, version, desc, exec entries).  e1pkg
unpacks the remaining members relative to /, records the installed
paths in /var/db/e1pkg/hello, and can remove them again with
"pkg remove hello".

The root filesystem is ramfs: installed files and the package
database disappear on reboot.
